          "title": "EV-000293"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0002",
      "content": "Blázquez-Garcíaら（2021）は時系列のunsupervised outlier/anomaly detection技術を対象として、検出技術の特徴に基づくtaxonomyを提示する。",
      "source_locator": "ACM Abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000172",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be39819f81cdcfb127d848eb",
          "title": "EV-000294"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0003",
      "content": "Matrix Profile Iは部分系列のall-pairs similarity joinによりmotifとdiscordを計算し、novelty/discord発見に適用する。",
      "source_locator": "IEEE Abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000173",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be3981cb9dc4df37d7e17f3d",
          "title": "EV-000295"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0004",
      "content": "OmniAnomalyはstochastic recurrent networkとflow等で多変量時系列の通常パターンを学習し、再構成確率で異常を判定する。",
      "source_locator": "KDD Abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000174",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be398110a87fc1d39478b1d1",
          "title": "EV-000296"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0005",
      "content": "Anomaly Transformerは自己注意で表現される時点間associationとassociation discrepancyを異常点の識別指標として提案する。",
      "source_locator": "ICLR Abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000175",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be39813da984d9eacbffc350",
          "title": "EV-000297"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0006",
      "content": "TranADは多変量時系列のTransformer異常検知・診断モデルとしてself-conditioning、adversarial training、MAMLを組み込む。",
      "source_locator": "PVLDB Abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000176",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be3981398573df2cf1ef73a7",
          "title": "EV-000298"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0007",
      "content": "Kimら（2022）はpoint adjustmentで時系列異常検知F1が過大評価され、ランダムスコアが高性能検知手法のように扱われ得ると理論・実験で示した。",
      "source_locator": "AAAI Abstract",
      "note_type": "Limitation",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000177",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be3981ecb9d6ede655fd5d10",
          "title": "EV-000299"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0008",
      "content": "LiuとPaparrizos（2024）のTSB-ADは40データセット由来の1070時系列と40手法の比較を提供し、VUS-PRを推奨する。単純手法が深層手法に勝る条件があると報告した。",
      "source_locator": "NeurIPS Abstract",
      "note_type": "Result",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000178",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be398184b96cd4d97c8cd10d",
          "title": "EV-000300"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0009",
      "content": "Zhuら（2026）は5系統の時系列基盤モデルを比較し、再構成・予測誤差に基づく異常検知の性能が移動分散・平方差の単純基準と大きく変わらないと報告した。",
      "source_locator": "ICLR Abstract",
      "note_type": "Counterargument",
      "selection_reason": "Methodological taxonomy, benchmark validity or important counterevidence within the adopted scope.",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000179",
        "evidence_note": {
